From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Toon Verwaest <verwaest@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 12:05:59 +0200
Subject: [parser] Consolidate and remove redundant AcceptINScopes

- Drop `AcceptINScope(this, true)` in `ParseForEachStatementWithDeclarations`,
  `ParseForEachStatementWithoutDeclarations`, `ParseForAwaitStatement`, and
  `Parser::ParseExportDefault`, where `accept_IN_` is already `true`.
- Move `AcceptINScope(this, true)` into `ParsePossibleDestructuringSubPattern`
  and `ParseFunctionBody` (`FunctionBodyType::kBlock`) instead of repeating it
  at each call site.
- Remove unused `ParseConditionalContinuation`.

Bug: 567222737
